# Dragon Magazine Compendium - features of those substitution levels (subst_build.py).


###Block: Aasimar Incarnate substitution levels
Aasimar Incarnate	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:Aasimar incarnates who strike true against the forces of evil. Requirements: a neutral good aasimar about to take the 1st, 3rd or 7th incarnate level.
Martial Weapon	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Martial Weapon	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:He selects any martial melee weapon (usually the warhammer, the weapon of the good incarnate weapon soulmeld) and gains Martial Weapon Proficiency and Weapon Focus with it (choose by hand). Replaces nothing.
Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:While his incarnum radiance is active his natural and weapon attacks count as good-aligned against damage reduction, and an incarnate weapon soulmeld deals +1d6 damage to creatures of the evil subtype (not shared with allies). Augments incarnum radiance.
Share Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	KEY:Aasimar Incarnate ~ Share Incarnum Radiance (Aasimar)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.315	DESC:He can share his incarnum radiance with any nonevil ally (not only good allies), chosen when it is activated, but not the good alignment of his attacks. Augments share incarnum radiance.

###Block: Gnome Incarnate substitution levels
Gnome Incarnate	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Gnome incarnates defending their villages. Requirements: a neutral good gnome about to take the 1st, 2nd or 7th incarnate level.
Racial Defense	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Racial Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:An insight bonus on damage rolls against kobolds, goblinoids and giants equal to half the number of soulmelds he has shaped (the full number with another gnome ally visible within 30 feet). Replaces detect opposition.
Detect Thoughts	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Detect Thoughts	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While a soulmeld is bound to his crown chakra he can use detect thoughts once per day (save DC 12 + Charisma modifier, caster level = meldshaper level). Replaces nothing.
Share Incarnum Radiance (Gnome)	KEY:Gnome Incarnate ~ Share Incarnum Radiance (Gnome)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Allies sharing his incarnum radiance also gain a +4 dodge bonus to AC against giants (not stacking with a racial dodge bonus against giants). Augments share incarnum radiance.

###Block: Tiefling Incarnate substitution levels
Tiefling Incarnate	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:Tiefling incarnates mingling mortal souls with fiendish minds. Requirements: a neutral evil tiefling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 7th incarnate level. Class skills: the incarnate's plus Bluff and Hide; 4 + Int skill points (by hand).
See in Darkness	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ See in Darkness	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:With a shaped soulmeld occupying her brow chakra she sees normally in magical darkness (such as a darkness spell). Replaces nothing.
Incarnum Radiance (Tiefling)	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Incarnum Radiance (Tiefling)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While not in bright illumination she has concealment (20%% miss chance) even against creatures that see normally in such conditions. Augments incarnum radiance.
Telepathy	KEY:Tiefling Incarnate ~ Telepathy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Incarnate Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.316	DESC:While a soulmeld is bound to her crown chakra she can communicate telepathically with any creature with a language within 100 feet. Replaces share incarnum radiance.

###Block: Dwarf Soulborn substitution levels
Dwarf Soulborn	KEY:Dwarf Soulborn ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.583	DESC:Dwarf soulborns, champions of Moradin. Requirements: a lawful good dwarf about to take the 1st, 3rd or 9th soulborn level.
Smite Opposition (Dwarf)	KEY:Dwarf Soulborn ~ Smite Opposition (Dwarf)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.583	DESC:Delivering his smite with a warhammer, he adds +1 on the attack roll (as if his Charisma were 2 points higher) - his link to the Hammer of Souls of Moradin. Augments smite opposition.
Stoneborn Insight	KEY:Dwarf Soulborn ~ Stoneborn Insight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.583	DESC:An insight bonus equal to the number of soulmelds he has shaped on Appraise and Craft checks about stone or metal, Search checks related to stonecunning, and damage rolls against orcs, goblinoids and giants. Replaces the soulborn bonus feat gained at 3rd level (the repository describes the soulborn bonus feats without a selection pool - by hand).
Share Incarnum Defense (Dwarf)	KEY:Dwarf Soulborn ~ Share Incarnum Defense (Dwarf)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.583	DESC:He can share his incarnum defense with any dwarf within 30 feet he can see as a free action (instead of by touch as a standard action). Augments share incarnum defense.

###Block: Elf Soulborn substitution levels
Elf Soulborn	KEY:Elf Soulborn ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.584	DESC:Elf soulborns charging their arrows with incarnum. Requirements: a chaotic good elf about to take the 1st, 2nd or 7th soulborn level.
Smite Opposition (Elf)	KEY:Elf Soulborn ~ Smite Opposition (Elf)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.584	DESC:She can deliver her smite with an arrow fired from a bow at a foe within 30 feet, or in melee as normal. Augments smite opposition.
Incarnum Defense (Elf)	KEY:Elf Soulborn ~ Incarnum Defense (Elf)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Immunity to Charm	SOURCEPAGE:p.584	DESC:Her eyes become solid orbs of deep forest green: immunity to enchantment (charm) effects (applied). Augments incarnum defense.
Vigilance of the Ancestors	KEY:Elf Soulborn ~ Vigilance of the Ancestors	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Soulborn Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.584	DESC:Her low-light vision triples normal human sight; with a soulmeld occupying her brow chakra, an insight bonus on Search and Spot checks of twice its invested essentia; with a soulmeld bound there, +50%% range increment for bows she uses. Replaces the soulborn bonus feat gained at 7th level (by hand, as above).

###Block: Halfling Totemist substitution levels
Halfling Totemist	KEY:Halfling Totemist ~ Substitution Levels	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Totemist Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.621	DESC:Halfling totemists, darting quickly like the beasts whose souls they channel. Requirements: a halfling about to take the 1st, 3rd or 8th totemist level.
Low-Light Vision (Totemist)	KEY:Halfling Totemist ~ Low-Light Vision (Totemist)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Totemist Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.621	DESC:While any soulmeld occupies her brow chakra she has low-light vision. Replaces nothing.
Wild Vigor	KEY:Halfling Totemist ~ Wild Vigor	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Totemist Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.621	DESC:With a soulmeld in her arms chakra +2 competence on Swim checks, in her feet chakra +2 on Jump, in her hands chakra +2 on Climb. Replaces totem's protection.
Fast Movement (Totemist)	KEY:Halfling Totemist ~ Fast Movement (Totemist)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Totemist Class Feature	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE.Walk|10|PREVAREQ:ENCUMBERANCE,0|!PREEQUIP:1,TYPE=Armor.Medium,TYPE=Armor.Heavy	SOURCEPAGE:p.621	DESC:Her land speed is 10 feet faster than normal for her race in no or light armor and with no more than a light load (applied), as the barbarian's fast movement. Replaces rebind totem soulmeld at 8th level: she gains it at 12th level instead, with correspondingly fewer daily uses (by hand).
